# 5. Success Criteria
Version 1 is considered complete only when all of the following conditions are satisfied.
## Functional
✓ Historical data downloads correctly
✓ Live market data streams correctly
✓ Feature engineering pipeline is deterministic
✓ Model training is reproducible
✓ Backtesting executes successfully
✓ Paper trading executes successfully
✓ Live trading can be enabled through configuration
---
## Quantitative
✓ Positive expected value after fees
✓ Walk-forward validation passes
✓ Monte Carlo robustness acceptable
✓ Maximum drawdown remains within defined limits
✓ Strategy demonstrates stability across validation windows
---
## Engineering
✓ Every module tested
✓ Logging implemented
✓ Configuration documented
✓ Code reproducible
✓ Clean architecture maintained
